<title>PHILIPPINES: RFM, Urban to build condominium.</title>
<headline>RFM, Urban to build condominium.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food conglomerate RFM Corp and UrbanCorp Realty Developers Inc will build a 41-storey condominium in the emerging Bonifacio city, east of Manila, RFM said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We would take advantage of the continuing booming Philippine property sector even beyond the turn of the century as we contribute our share in the development of Fort Bonifacio,&quot; RFM chairman Jose Concepcion III said in a statement.</p>
<p>The two companies are part of the consortium which will develop the 214-hectare lot in Fort Bonifacio.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
